+Stage 6 result: pass.
+
+## 7. Proven versus assumed accounting
+
+### Formally established
+
+Conditional on the supplied MPY/K theory, for every finite `IS:IntSeq`, calling
+the exact translated `is_bored` closure in the stated initial configuration
